# Allowlist: the image build needs exactly these inputs. README.md and LICENSE are
# required because pyproject.toml declares them.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!nanio_orchestrator
!docker
!ui

# ...but never bytecode caches, nor a panel built or installed on the host: the image builds its own.
ui/node_modules
nanio_orchestrator/web/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
